{"id":"wb-6-222","name":"利玛窦和外国传教士墓地","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"滕公栅栏","text":"滕公栅栏，位于北京市西城区展览路街道车公庄大街6号北京行政学院院内，是明朝至中华民国时期的天主教墓地，安葬了许多来华西方天主教传教士及其他天主教教士、教民。现仅存利玛窦墓等一小部分。墓地旁边原有马尾沟教堂。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%BB%95%E5%85%AC%E6%A0%85%E6%A0%8F","revisionId":94516299,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94516299","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核百科重定向、文物名称与同一地点；引用版本已锁定","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/81706620d4d2c0ddd81264da.jpg","title":"北京利玛窦和外国传教士墓地2023.5_(1).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E5%88%A9%E7%8E%9B%E7%AA%A6%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E4%BC%A0%E6%95%99%E5%A3%AB%E5%A2%93%E5%9C%B02023.5_(1).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/eb/%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E5%88%A9%E7%8E%9B%E7%AA%A6%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%BD%E4%BC%A0%E6%95%99%E5%A3%AB%E5%A2%93%E5%9C%B02023.5_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"ScareCriterion12","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​北京市西城区车公庄大街6号 滕公栅栏（利玛窦和外国传教士墓地）","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"滕公栅栏"}}